{
  "intro": "Avec Anima is an underground house and tech house night on the Isle of Man, running events at venues across the island — from Douglas clubs to one-off nights in the glens. No two are the same.\n\nIt all starts with the music: selectors who dig deep, a properly tuned sound and a crowd that comes to dance. The posters, the films and the photos all come from the same place — so every night feels like Anima from the first announcement to the last record.",
